%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: YuriGoesToMarkarth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756544
    - rid: 1790118857467756545
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Let's see here...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756546
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Based on what the map says, I should be able to just follow down this
      road until I reach Markarth.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756547
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756604
    - rid: 1790118857467756605
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah. A ruined fortress?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756606
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (This land being all but plagued with ruins is... interesting.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756607
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (The ancient Nordic ruins make sense; the reason they aren't maintained
      is because they came from a political paradigm that ended millennia ago.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756608
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (But what of this one? Its stonework doesn't seem that much older than
      the Western Watchtower, which is still in use.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756610
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Perhaps it's a matter of the economics?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I've only ever seen dozens of people in the two "major" cities of Skyrim
      I've visited.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756612
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I doubt taxes alone could fund a fort they wouldn't be able to man anyway-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756611
    - rid: 1790118857467756620
    - rid: 1790118857467756621
    - rid: 1790118857467756622
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756613
    - rid: 1790118857467756614
    - rid: 1790118857467756615
    - rid: 1790118857467756616
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>Aaaah</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756617
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Brigands in the fort!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Seeing that they're only shooting arrows at her, Yuri makes the split
      second decision to run down the road.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756618
    - rid: 1790118857467756633
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756625
    - rid: 1790118857467756626
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I can see why {mc} wanted us to get involved with a guild; Skyrim is
      not a friendly place for lone travelers...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756627
    - rid: 1790118857467756628
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756629
    - rid: 1790118857467756630
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh no... what happened here? Are there more bandits about?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756631
    - rid: 1790118857467756632
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ad5dd808ad82574db508b579bfc59b8, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, what do we have here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756634
    - rid: 1790118857467756635
    - rid: 1790118876029648905
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ad5dd808ad82574db508b579bfc59b8, type: 2}
    dialog: You saw what I did to this poor cat, eh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756636
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ad5dd808ad82574db508b579bfc59b8, type: 2}
    dialog: It was a shame, he thought he could get away with not paying me my due.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ad5dd808ad82574db508b579bfc59b8, type: 2}
    dialog: You wouldn't make the same mistake, would you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-uh... well...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (... wait a minute, this is just <i>one</i> bandit.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648897
    - rid: 1790118876029648906
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I was able to fight Ancano who had the power of an ancient artifact
      of seemingly immeasurable strength!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648898
    - rid: 1790118876029648907
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Didn't {mc} say something about the people here having a poor sense
      of self-preservation?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648899
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ad5dd808ad82574db508b579bfc59b8, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't have all day, are you gonna fork over the valuables, or am I
      gonna fork you with my blade?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648900
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri summons her dagger to do battle with the bandit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648901
    - rid: 1790118876029648902
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ad5dd808ad82574db508b579bfc59b8, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah shite, a wizard-?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ad5dd808ad82574db508b579bfc59b8, type: 2}
    dialog: The hard way it is, then!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648912
    - rid: 1790118876029648913
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648903
    - rid: 1790118876029648908
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Phew...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648909
    - rid: 1790118876029648911
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648914
    - rid: 1790118876029648916
    - rid: 1790118876029648917
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Whoa...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648918
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (This is a beautiful view!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648919
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (A flowing river running through a mountain valley, accented by the ruins
      of an ancient culture...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648920
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I've actually dreamt of going to a place like this for a vacation when
      I was younger...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648921
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, minus the malcontent, of course.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648922
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648923
    - rid: 1790118876029648924
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh! A shrine out here in the open?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648925
    - rid: 1790118876029648926
    - rid: 1790118876029648927
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Excuse me miss, who is this shrine dedicated to?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648928
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 66d6f68494b332a4dae8cde681feb96f, type: 2}
    dialog: (Dark times indeed...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648929
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 66d6f68494b332a4dae8cde681feb96f, type: 2}
    dialog: 'My dear, this shrine is dedicated to the goddess Dibella, whose domain
      is all things beautiful: the arts, friendship, and love. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, one of the Nine Divines, correct?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648930
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 66d6f68494b332a4dae8cde681feb96f, type: 2}
    dialog: ... You would be wise to keep your, ahem, "heresy" to yourself-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648931
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 66d6f68494b332a4dae8cde681feb96f, type: 2}
    dialog: But yes, she is.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648932
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 66d6f68494b332a4dae8cde681feb96f, type: 2}
    dialog: Would you like to make an offering to Dibella?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, no thank you...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648933
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 66d6f68494b332a4dae8cde681feb96f, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you sure? Surely a fine young woman like yourself could use Dibella's
      favor when pursuing a husband...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648934
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, w-well, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648936
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (It wouldn't be any use while he's... inconsolable.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648937
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm fine, I really should be continuing on my journey...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648938
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 66d6f68494b332a4dae8cde681feb96f, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh well. Safe journeys.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648939
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648940
    - rid: 1790118876029648941
    - rid: 1790118876029648942
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Pursuing a husband, huh...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648943
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe that would be a good way to maintain some sense of normalcy, despite
      everything that's happened to us in the last week...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648944
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (But would I even have the time to do it? We're going to be busy discovering
      the underlying truth of this world's firmament...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (... I should just keep going.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648945
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648946
    - rid: 1790118876029648947
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Is that... Markarth?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648948
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Even from this far away, the stonework is notably different from the
      styles I saw at Windhelm, Winterhold, and Whiterun.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648949
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I suppose I'm lucky I never encountered a Forsworn... maybe Mr. gro-Shub
      was operating on outdated information?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648951
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648952
    - rid: 1790118876029648953
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b7d4f7be8ddc24a428f2bccd5c5019ac, type: 2}
    dialog: This is Markarth, traveler. Safest city in the Reach.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648954
    - rid: 1790118876029648955
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I don't remember seeing any other cities in the Reach on my map...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648956
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Excuse me sir, do you know where a man named Calcelmo is?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648962
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b7d4f7be8ddc24a428f2bccd5c5019ac, type: 2}
    dialog: Calcelmo, eh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648963
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b7d4f7be8ddc24a428f2bccd5c5019ac, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye, he's the court wizard for Jarl Igmund. You should be able to find
      him in his laboratory in Understone Keep.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b7d4f7be8ddc24a428f2bccd5c5019ac, type: 2}
    dialog: Just take a left when you enter the keep.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you, sir.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648964
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648957
    - rid: 1790118876029648958
    - rid: 1790118876029648959
    - rid: 1790118876029648960
    - rid: 1790118876029648961
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh, well isn't this a quaint little market?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648965
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d41477e520fd6714faed613702e50c87, type: 2}
    dialog: Fresh meat, get your fresh meat here!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648966
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe I would buy some if I hadn't stocked up so much for my journey...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648967
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d41477e520fd6714faed613702e50c87, type: 2}
    dialog: The finest jewlery, made from the finest silver-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648968
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d41477e520fd6714faed613702e50c87, type: 2}
    dialog: You there!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648969
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d41477e520fd6714faed613702e50c87, type: 2}
    dialog: I have a necklace that would look lovely on you, or on a... special someone.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I definitely don't have the money to be spending on jewelry...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648971
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (But there's no harm in looking, is there?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648972
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d41477e520fd6714faed613702e50c87, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, caught your attention, have I?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648973
    - rid: 1790118876029648974
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d41477e520fd6714faed613702e50c87, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well, for you I''d recommend this piece:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648975
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d41477e520fd6714faed613702e50c87, type: 2}
    dialog: The double amethyst design would match your hair and eyes, bringing a
      purple sparkle to your attire.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648976
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: You might be right, although I would have to buy this necklace some other
      time-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648978
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Mmf-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648979
    - rid: 1790118876029648980
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648981
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Thanks to <b>your</b> help, Yuri was able to avoid being killed from
      behind.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648984
    - rid: 1790118876029648985
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Turning around to face her attacker, Yuri finds that the dagger that
      once tried to reach her back is now going for her stomach.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648986
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ffbf113318f764849ba51b1f1c55a79d, type: 2}
    dialog: For the Forsworn!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648988
    - rid: 1790118876029648990
    - rid: 1790118876029648991
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d41477e520fd6714faed613702e50c87, type: 2}
    dialog: Gods, there's Forsworn here in the city!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648992
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b7d4f7be8ddc24a428f2bccd5c5019ac, type: 2}
    dialog: There's nothing to see here; there are <i>no</i> Forsworn in the city.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648993
    - rid: 1790118876029648994
    - rid: 1790118876029648995
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648996
    - rid: 1790118876029648997
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I spoke too soon about the quality of Mr. gro-Shub's perspective...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118876029648998
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
